{"id":"a744570f627796b9","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Ladder Coloring","display":"df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring — ZFC Comb9 Ladder Coloring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring — ZFC Comb9 Ladder Coloring","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring — ZFC Comb9 Ladder Coloring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"644bb6a06a77da42\" href=\"?note=644bb6a06a77da42\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (set of limit ordinals), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (ladder system on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> (set of colors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> (family of colorings indexed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\\)</span> is the canonical ladder-system predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"644bb6a06a77da42\" href=\"?note=644bb6a06a77da42\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the set-function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9LadderColoring}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9LadderColoring}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}coloring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9LadderColoring}_S(c,L,S,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in V\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(c,S,\\bigcup_{\\delta\\in S}{}^{L(\\delta)}\\theta\\right)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Function}(c(\\delta),L(\\delta),\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}coloring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9LadderColoring}_S(c,L,S,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in V\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(c,S,\\bigcup_{\\delta\\in S}{}^{L(\\delta)}\\theta\\right)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Function}(c(\\delta),L(\\delta),\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> is now required to be a function, and the ladder hypothesis uses the exact upstream predicate rather than an undeclared near-synonym.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"644bb6a06a77da42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"644bb6a06a77da42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)$ is the canonical ladder-system predicate (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb8-ladder-system.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the set-function predicate (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9LadderColoring}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}coloring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9LadderColoring}_S(c,L,S,\\theta)\\leftrightarrow\\theta\\in V\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcComb8LadderSystem}_S(L,S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(c,S,\\bigcup_{\\delta\\in S}{}^{L(\\delta)}\\theta\\right)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Function}(c(\\delta),L(\\delta),\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false}],"bytes":1399,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1735","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring.md|58-df-zfc-comb9-ladder-coloring]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","644bb6a06a77da42","36d7463d215be751"]}